# Build context for docker/Dockerfile (Dockerfile-specific ignore file).
#
# Keeps the context to the source snapshot: no VCS metadata, no installed
# dependencies, and no previously generated build output. The repository is
# only ~160 MB of source, so the transfer is cheap once these are excluded.

.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.gitlab-ci.yml

**/node_modules
**/lib
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.dsh-build
.DS_Store
*.log
.env
.env.*

# Container glue: only the runtime pieces — entrypoint.mjs, reverse-proxy.mjs,
# dsh-docker-entrypoint, and shell/ — are COPYed into the image. The build
# helpers and documentation stay in the repository.
docker/README.md
docker/README.zh.md
docker/build.sh
docker/run.sh
docker/docker-compose.yml
docker/.env.example
docker/.gitignore
docker/test
docker/dist
